<title>USA: FSA qualifies Beaver, Pa., school bond issue.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies Beaver, Pa., school bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Tuesday is qualified for bond insurance Beaver Area School District, Pa.'s $13.875 million general obligation bond issue, set for competitive sale at 1130 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
